## 2. Migration Flow Diagram (Phased Approach)

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    subgraph PHASE1["PHASE 1: ASSESS (Weeks 1-2)"]
        A1[Inventory\n1,247 tables]
        A2[Query Log\nAnalysis]
        A3[TCO Model\nApproved]
        A4[Risk Register\n12 risks]
    end

    subgraph PHASE2["PHASE 2: PILOT (Weeks 3-6)"]
        P1[5 Workloads\nSelected]
        P2[Data Parity\n100% match]
        P3[Performance\n2min vs 45min]
        P4[Sign-off\nBusiness UAT]
    end

    subgraph PHASE3["PHASE 3: MIGRATE (Weeks 7-22)"]
        M1[Historical Load\nDataproc Parallel]
