## 3. Data Flow - Streaming Pipeline Detail

```mermaid
flowchart TB
    subgraph PRODUCER["📤 PRODUCERS"]
        KFK[Kafka Topics\nuser.events, txn.events]
        DB[Debezium CDC\nMySQL/Postgres]
    end

    subgraph INGEST_LAYER["🔄 DATASTREAM / PUBSUB"]
        DS[Datastream\nCDC → Pub/Sub]
        PS[Pub/Sub Topics\nPartitioned by key]
        DLQ[Dead Letter Topic\nFailed messages]
    end

    subgraph PROCESSING["⚙️ DATAFLOW STREAMING"]
        W1[Window: Fixed 5min\nAllowed Lateness 10min]
        W2[Watermark\nEvent-time based]
        TRANS[Transform DoFn\nValidate, Enrich, Dedup]
        SIDE[Side Input\nReference Data\nRefreshed hourly]
        AGG[Aggregation\nSession Windows]
    end

    subgraph SINK["🎯 BIGQUERY SINK"]
        BQ_STREAM[BigQuery Storage\nWrite API\nStreaming inserts]
        BQ_TABLE[Partitioned by\nevent_date\nClustered by user_id]
        MV[Materialized View\nPre-aggregated\nHourly rollups]
    end

    subgraph MONITORING["📈 OBSERVABILITY"]
        M1[Dataflow Metrics\nLag, throughput, errors]
        M2[BigQuery Metrics\nBytes, slots, latency]
        M3[Alerting\nPub/Sub → Cloud Monitoring\nPagerDuty/Slack]
    end

    KFK --> DS
    DB --> DS
    DS --> PS
    PS -->|Main| W1
    PS -.->|Failed| DLQ

    W1 --> W2 --> TRANS
    TRANS --> SIDE
    TRANS --> AGG
    AGG --> BQ_STREAM
    BQ_STREAM --> BQ_TABLE
    BQ_TABLE --> MV

    W1 -.-> M1
    TRANS -.-> M1
    BQ_STREAM -.-> M2
    M1 --> M3
    M2 --> M3

    classDef prod fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1976d2
    classDef ingest fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#f57c00
    classDef proc fill:#fce4ec,stroke:#c2185b
    classDef sink fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#388e3c
    classDef mon fill:#f3e5f5,stroke:#7b1fa2

    class KFK,DB prod
    class DS,PS,DLQ ingest
    class W1,W2,TRANS,SIDE,AGG proc
    class BQ_STREAM,BQ_TABLE,MV sink
    class M1,M2,M3 mon
```

